 "intro_html": "The quick version of the <a href=\"japanese-curry.html\">from-scratch Japanese curry</a>: no homemade roux, stock or tomato sauce — the <b>S&amp;B Golden Curry</b> block does all of that. These are the box’s own method and amounts for half a box (one of the two trays), which makes 6 servings.",
