 "notes": [
  {
   "html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>The box says so: a roux block dropped into a boiling pot can clump.</li><li>Off the heat it melts smoothly; then it simmers to thicken.</li></ul>",
   "title_html": "Why the heat goes off for the roux"
  },
  {
   "html": "<p>The box suggests beef, chicken, lamb or shrimp — the same amount of any of them.</p>",
   "title_html": "Other meat"
  },
  {
   "html": "<p>Golden Curry comes mild, medium hot and hot; pick the box for the heat you want.</p>",
   "title_html": "Heat level"
  },
  {
   "html": "<p>Double everything (<span class=\"q\" data-k=\"mass\" data-u=\"g\" data-a=\"900\" data-s=\"0\">900 g</span> each of beef and onions, <span class=\"q\" data-k=\"mass\" data-u=\"g\" data-a=\"250\" data-s=\"0\">250 g</span> carrot, <span class=\"q\" data-k=\"mass\" data-u=\"g\" data-a=\"300\" data-s=\"0\">300 g</span> potatoes, <span class=\"q\" data-k=\"vol\" data-u=\"tbsp\" data-a=\"2\" data-s=\"0\">2 tbsp</span> oil) with <span class=\"q\" data-k=\"vol\" data-u=\"ml\" data-a=\"1200\" data-s=\"0\">1200 ml</span> water for 12 servings.</p>",
   "title_html": "The whole box"
  },
  {
   "html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Want the long version with your own roux, chicken stock and tomato sauce?</li><li>See <a href=\"japanese-curry.html\">Japanese curry from scratch</a>.</li></ul>",
   "title_html": "From scratch"
  }
 ],
